      "snippet": "Apex Global reported Q4 2024 revenue of $412 million, up 18% year over year, and adjusted EPS of $0.67, beating consensus by $0.09. In a January 2025 note, Stifel analyst Mara Levin raised the price target to $74 from $68, citing stronger oncology sales and a 22% improvement in operating margin.",
