      "snippet": "Shares of Apex Global rose 6.4% after the company said Q4 product revenue reached $289.3 million and full-year 2024 R&D spending totaled $1.1 billion. Jefferies analyst Daniel Choi said the biotech name \u201cexecuted cleanly\u201d but warned that 2025 guidance implies only mid-single-digit growth.",
