      "domain": "arxiv.org",
      "rank": 2
    },
    {
      "title": "Transformer-XL: Attentive Language Models Beyond a Fixed-Length Context",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.02860",
      "snippet": "Published by Zihang Dai, Zhilin Yang, Yiming Yang, Jaime Carbonell, Quoc V. Le, and Ruslan Salakhutdinov in 2019, Transformer-XL extended self-attention with recurrence. The model improved long-range dependency handling on language modeling benchmarks such as WikiText-103.",
